1
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:31,220
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:45,736
I know how furious you are.

3
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:47,656
But only by planning carefully

4
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:49,580
can we capture them all at once.

5
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:03,300
I watched A-Yue die before my eyes.

6
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:05,140
How can I remain calm?

7
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:11,540
Your Majesty, I have come
to escort you back...

8
00:02:24,640 --> 00:02:26,296
I will think carefully before acting.

9
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:28,460
The Bureau now has the case.

10
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,376
Your Majesty, please return to the palace.

11
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:32,296
What do you plan to do next?

12
00:02:32,320 --> 00:02:33,620
I need to know.

13
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:35,860
Otherwise, I cannot rest easy.

14
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:41,740
Since the gambling house
has discovered my identity,

15
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:44,336
and Lü Da bears a grudge against me,

16
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:45,416
they will not spare me.

17
00:02:45,440 --> 00:02:46,936
I believe

18
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:48,176
they will come looking for me.

19
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:49,096
If they come for you,

20
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,380
only two outcomes:

21
00:02:51,040 --> 00:02:52,300
recruit you,

22
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:54,100
or kill you.

23
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:57,300
I will handle it myself.

24
00:02:58,200 --> 00:02:59,860
Farewell, Your Majesty.

25
00:03:25,880 --> 00:03:27,216
This way, please.

26
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,296
Certainly.

27
00:03:28,320 --> 00:03:29,460
Come again.

28
00:03:32,880 --> 00:03:34,940
-I'll get the shopkeeper.
-All right.

29
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:47,296
Shopkeeper Yan.

30
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:50,656
I am Hao Wenming, proprietor
of Xingrong Gambling House.

31
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:52,220
Today,

32
00:03:52,880 --> 00:03:54,580
I came especially to visit...

33
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,336
Official Meng.

34
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,976
So it is Proprietor Hao.

35
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:01,456
What business do you
have with Official Meng?

36
00:04:01,480 --> 00:04:02,736
Official Meng

37
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:04,980
is not someone you may
see whenever you please.

38
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:06,940
Shopkeeper Yan,

39
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:09,656
I have come with tremendous sincerity

40
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:11,580
and substantial benefits.

41
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:15,336
This is Jade Nectar,

42
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:16,616
made in the bitterest cold.

43
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:18,576
Its brewing process is extremely complex.

44
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:21,780
It is rich and bracing,
with a lingering finish.

45
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:23,976
In the entire capital,

46
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:26,136
only I, Hao Wenming, can obtain it.

47
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:27,416
I can

48
00:04:27,440 --> 00:04:29,736
supply this wine
exclusively to Bofeng House

49
00:04:29,760 --> 00:04:31,180
at thirty percent

50
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:33,096
below market price.

51
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:35,536
Should you find that acceptable,

52
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:37,936
we may consider this
the start of our partnership.

53
00:04:37,960 --> 00:04:40,016
In return, introduce me to Official Meng.

54
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:42,300
What do you say?

55
00:04:46,080 --> 00:04:47,660
This wine...

56
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:49,700
is rather interesting.

57
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:53,140
One honored guest. Upstairs, please.

58
00:04:54,080 --> 00:04:55,340
Shopkeeper,

59
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,416
what did you hear from across the street?

60
00:04:57,440 --> 00:04:58,696
I heard Proprietor Hao

61
00:04:58,720 --> 00:05:00,416
seemed to have come
especially for Official Meng.

62
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:02,416
It seems Official Meng's case

63
00:05:02,440 --> 00:05:03,900
concerns Xingrong Gambling House.

64
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:06,380
I knew it.

65
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:08,456
That Yan Fuzhi and Meng Tinghui

66
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,536
must have

67
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:11,176
some shameful arrangement between them.

68
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:12,656
-Exactly.
-Today,

69
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:15,100
I will file a complaint against them.

70
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,420
Official Meng.

71
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:20,740
I have long heard of your reputation.

72
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:22,976
Only after seeing you today

73
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:26,176
do I understand beauty that
makes fish sink and geese fall,

74
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:28,696
and talent beyond compare.

75
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:30,816
For you to meet me today

76
00:05:30,840 --> 00:05:33,420
means my ancestors must be smiling upon me.

77
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:37,776
My ancestors are smiling?

78
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:39,580
My ancestral graves must have exploded.

79
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,740
Listen to me ramble.

80
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:44,016
The moment I saw Official Meng,

81
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:45,540
I became somewhat incoherent.

82
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:46,980
Proprietor Hao,

83
00:05:47,960 --> 00:05:50,056
one does not visit without a reason.

84
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:51,536
What brings you here

85
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:52,656
today?

86
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:54,300
I heard

87
00:05:54,640 --> 00:05:57,216
that Official Meng visited
Xingrong Gambling House last night.

88
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:59,216
I failed to welcome you personally

89
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:01,296
or ensure you enjoyed yourself.

90
00:06:01,320 --> 00:06:02,496
It was truly inexcusable.

91
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:03,736
So today,

92
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:06,380
I came especially to apologize,

93
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:08,456
and also

94
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:10,616
to become

95
00:06:10,640 --> 00:06:12,900
kindred spirits with Official Meng

96
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:14,940
and form a friendship.

97
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:20,740
Official Meng.

98
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:25,540
Open it.

99
00:06:33,440 --> 00:06:35,780
This is of exceptional quality.

100
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:37,780
And these pearls

101
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:40,340
are so large and perfectly round, my lord.

102
00:06:41,200 --> 00:06:43,256
You certainly have a discerning eye.

103
00:06:43,280 --> 00:06:44,420
Little brother,

104
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:47,540
this necklace...

105
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:48,616
No...

106
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:50,016
Here... Take it and enjoy it.

107
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,776
Official Meng and I

108
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:53,376
are discussing a business deal today.

109
00:06:53,400 --> 00:06:54,776
Once it is settled,

110
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:57,136
we will be brothers.

111
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:58,656
My lord.

112
00:06:58,680 --> 00:07:00,256
Brother Hao is most sincere.

113
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:01,420
Think it over.

114
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:04,380
Bring two more.

115
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:06,216
Proprietor Hao,

116
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:07,816
I have heard Xingrong Gambling House

117
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:09,820
has powerful patrons behind it.

118
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,736
Your business

119
00:07:11,760 --> 00:07:13,216
must be far from simple.

120
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:14,380
Official Meng.

121
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:17,816
You truly are well informed.

122
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:18,936
To be honest,

123
00:07:18,960 --> 00:07:20,176
our gambling house

124
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:22,576
does have some powerful patrons.

125
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:24,976
But those connections are minor.

126
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,096
We still need

127
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:28,536
a patron like you, Official Meng,

128
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:30,420
to lend us your support.

129
00:07:39,840 --> 00:07:40,980
Official Meng.

130
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:42,980
Please, sit.

131
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:53,496
Official Meng,

132
00:07:53,520 --> 00:07:56,456
you only need to sign
this partnership agreement.

133
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,696
From now on,

134
00:07:57,720 --> 00:08:00,576
we will be in the same boat.

135
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:02,860
Since this is a partnership agreement,

136
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:04,336
there are some things

137
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:05,900
you must tell me honestly.

138
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:08,096
What business

139
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:10,420
is really conducted on the second floor?

140
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:12,936
And who exactly

141
00:08:12,960 --> 00:08:14,816
are those masked gamblers?

142
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:16,180
Official Meng,

143
00:08:16,520 --> 00:08:18,780
certain secrets

144
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:23,500
may only be told to those in the same boat.

145
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:26,340
Once you sign,

146
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:27,616
I guarantee

147
00:08:27,640 --> 00:08:31,100
I will tell you everything I know.

148
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:35,816
Official Meng,

149
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:37,136
why do you hesitate?

150
00:08:37,160 --> 00:08:39,296
Do you not trust me,

151
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:42,420
or do you not wish to become one of us?

152
00:08:43,160 --> 00:08:44,776
I am only wondering

153
00:08:44,800 --> 00:08:47,060
whether a mere twenty percent

154
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:50,180
is worth risking my official post.

155
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:52,656
Exactly.

156
00:08:52,680 --> 00:08:53,936
I demand at least...

157
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:55,380
-Sev...
-Thirty percent.

158
00:08:58,880 --> 00:09:00,380
Thirty percent.

159
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,256
Not a fraction less,

160
00:09:02,280 --> 00:09:04,616
or this agreement is void.

161
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:06,020
Official Meng,

162
00:09:06,640 --> 00:09:08,776
you certainly know how to bargain.

163
00:09:08,800 --> 00:09:10,700
Thirty percent it is.

164
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:18,856
-Bring a brush.
-My lord.

165
00:09:18,880 --> 00:09:20,420
On second thought,

166
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:22,616
signing this agreement

167
00:09:22,640 --> 00:09:24,056
may leave evidence against me.

168
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:26,100
-Bring the brush.
-Little brother.

169
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:43,020
Official Meng, how decisive.

170
00:09:44,640 --> 00:09:46,020
Proprietor Hao,

171
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:48,536
what about what I asked earlier?

172
00:09:48,560 --> 00:09:50,940
We are on the same side now.

173
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:52,456
Let us drink and talk.

174
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:54,100
-Come.
-Come.

175
00:10:04,280 --> 00:10:05,616
Well...

176
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:06,736
On the second floor,

177
00:10:06,760 --> 00:10:08,940
certain special guests

178
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:11,900
require special entertainment.

179
00:10:12,760 --> 00:10:15,100
You understand, little brother.

180
00:10:15,880 --> 00:10:16,856
I understand...

181
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:18,496
Come, little brother.

182
00:10:18,520 --> 00:10:19,820
-Come.
-Cheers.

183
00:10:23,280 --> 00:10:24,620
I heard

184
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:27,300
the once-every-fortnight...

185
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:30,060
Flower Banquet

186
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:33,540
is quite lively.

187
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:35,660
Brother.

188
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:39,776
Come, little brother.

189
00:10:39,800 --> 00:10:40,976
Come, little brother.

190
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:42,340
As for me,

191
00:10:42,880 --> 00:10:45,816
I would also like to join the fun

192
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:47,500
and see it for myself.

193
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:50,620
Normally,

194
00:10:51,160 --> 00:10:53,300
since we are now one of us,

195
00:10:53,640 --> 00:10:54,976
going upstairs

196
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:56,580
would be no problem.

197
00:10:57,520 --> 00:10:58,740
However...

198
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:02,620
What are you looking for, brother?

199
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,816
Tomorrow's Flower Banquet

200
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:09,940
will not be held upstairs.

201
00:11:10,520 --> 00:11:14,216
It will be at our leader's
estate in the western suburbs,

202
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:15,380
Spring Night Courtyard.

203
00:11:15,880 --> 00:11:18,736
That is not a place just anyone can enter.

204
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:20,376
Even if you wish to go,

205
00:11:20,400 --> 00:11:22,100
you must wait.

206
00:11:24,280 --> 00:11:25,580
Brother,

207
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:29,216
your leader is truly mysterious.

208
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:31,096
The last time I met him,

209
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,296
he nearly killed me.

210
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:34,336
As the saying goes,

211
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:37,500
friendship often follows a fight.

212
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:39,856
Come, have a drink.

213
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:41,136
Come, little brother.

214
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:42,300
Official Meng.

215
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:45,220
What was your leader's name again?

216
00:11:48,080 --> 00:11:50,220
Ling Yunfei.

217
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:53,536
Ling Yunfei.

218
00:11:53,560 --> 00:11:56,136
Fei...

219
00:11:56,160 --> 00:11:57,780
Fei.

220
00:12:08,040 --> 00:12:10,536
She is nothing but
a greedy female official.

221
00:12:10,560 --> 00:12:12,340
Now that she has signed the agreement,

222
00:12:12,560 --> 00:12:15,136
she will have to obey me.

223
00:12:15,160 --> 00:12:16,136
Leader,

224
00:12:16,160 --> 00:12:17,056
Meng Tinghui

225
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:19,536
obediently signed the agreement.

226
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:21,336
From now on,

227
00:12:21,360 --> 00:12:23,140
she can no longer interfere with us.

228
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:24,660
You can trust

229
00:12:24,920 --> 00:12:26,336
how I handle matters.

230
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:28,220
These officials

231
00:12:28,800 --> 00:12:30,700
act virtuous in public,

232
00:12:31,160 --> 00:12:32,976
but engage in sordid dealings in private.

233
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:34,616
Their greatest fear is exposure.

234
00:12:34,640 --> 00:12:36,096
Over the years,

235
00:12:36,120 --> 00:12:37,860
we have used these agreements

236
00:12:38,280 --> 00:12:40,136
to control many officials in the capital.

237
00:12:40,160 --> 00:12:41,856
It seems

238
00:12:41,880 --> 00:12:43,380
Meng Tinghui

239
00:12:44,280 --> 00:12:45,940
is nothing special after all.

240
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:51,780
Meng Tinghui nearly died by my hand.

241
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:53,816
without even blinking.

242
00:12:53,840 --> 00:12:55,336
One drinking session was enough?

243
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:57,016
It was more than one drinking session.

244
00:12:57,040 --> 00:12:59,096
There was also a large
chest of gold, silver, and jewels.

245
00:12:59,120 --> 00:13:00,096
She will also receive

246
00:13:00,120 --> 00:13:01,416
thirty percent of our profits.

247
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:02,736
How generous of you.

248
00:13:02,760 --> 00:13:04,376
Exactly how many secrets

249
00:13:04,400 --> 00:13:06,140
did you reveal to her while drunk?

250
00:13:16,520 --> 00:13:17,700
My lord, be careful.

251
00:13:18,960 --> 00:13:20,336
This Flower Banquet

252
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:22,176
is even more remote than I imagined.

253
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:23,096
Do not worry, my lord.

254
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:24,896
As long as we follow
Hao Wenming's carriage,

255
00:13:24,920 --> 00:13:25,976
we will be able to track them.

256
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:27,216
My lord,

257
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:29,496
His Majesty has not yet
replied to our secret memorial.

258
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:31,336
Acting now exceeds our authority.

259
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:32,296
Not this again.

260
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:33,856
If we await approval for everything,

261
00:13:33,880 --> 00:13:35,256
it will be far too late.

262
00:13:35,280 --> 00:13:37,136
Go back if you are afraid.

263
00:13:37,160 --> 00:13:38,456
Had I truly been afraid,

264
00:13:38,480 --> 00:13:40,096
I would not be here.

265
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:41,656
I was appointed Assistant
Director by imperial decree.

266
00:13:41,680 --> 00:13:43,256
I follow the laws of the court,

267
00:13:43,280 --> 00:13:44,176
unlike you,

268
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:45,296
who relies only on clever tricks

269
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:46,616
and reckless schemes.

270
00:13:46,640 --> 00:13:48,260
Reckless schemes?

271
00:13:48,560 --> 00:13:50,700
Your laws are useless

272
00:13:51,480 --> 00:13:52,976
against the Tiger Roar Gang.

273
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:54,340
Stop arguing.

274
00:13:54,760 --> 00:13:56,140
We must adapt in an emergency.

275
00:13:56,680 --> 00:13:57,856
Let us follow them first.

276
00:13:57,880 --> 00:13:59,220
We must keep our distance.

277
00:14:48,240 --> 00:14:49,380
No!

278
00:14:58,160 --> 00:14:59,460
Get away!

279
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:10,380
The Leader truly foresaw everything.

280
00:15:11,320 --> 00:15:12,500
The guards reported

281
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:14,776
that Meng Tinghui and two trusted aides

282
00:15:14,800 --> 00:15:15,976
have gone to Spring Night Courtyard.

283
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:18,860
Everything is within the Leader's grasp.

284
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:22,096
Exactly how many secrets

285
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:23,776
did you reveal to her while drunk?

286
00:15:23,800 --> 00:15:25,496
Leader, do not worry.

287
00:15:25,520 --> 00:15:27,296
I kept distracting her with idle chatter.

288
00:15:27,320 --> 00:15:28,896
I also held something back.

289
00:15:28,920 --> 00:15:31,336
I deliberately gave her a false
location for the Flower Banquet.

290
00:15:31,360 --> 00:15:32,736
Even if she goes there,

291
00:15:32,760 --> 00:15:33,736
she will find nothing.

292
00:15:33,760 --> 00:15:34,900
That is not enough.

293
00:15:36,040 --> 00:15:37,540
If she dares come,

294
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:40,820
I will ensure she never leaves.

295
00:15:50,760 --> 00:15:52,736
Are we abandoning the carriage? This...

296
00:15:52,760 --> 00:15:53,900
Are we here?

297
00:15:54,560 --> 00:15:55,740
Let us go take a look.

298
00:15:58,080 --> 00:15:59,220
My lord...

299
00:16:32,680 --> 00:16:33,860
Run!

300
00:16:38,520 --> 00:16:39,856
Is there enough gunpowder?

301
00:16:39,880 --> 00:16:41,016
Do not worry, Leader.

302
00:16:41,040 --> 00:16:43,300
It will blow them to ashes.

303
00:17:07,560 --> 00:17:08,776
I heard the Xiyan flower

304
00:17:08,800 --> 00:17:10,616
is greatly beloved in Beijian.

305
00:17:10,640 --> 00:17:12,976
Many musicians often
wear it as an ornament.

306
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:14,376
I specifically ordered

307
00:17:14,400 --> 00:17:16,456
the banquet decorated with these flowers.

308
00:17:16,480 --> 00:17:18,420
I wonder whether they please the envoys.

309
00:17:19,280 --> 00:17:20,376
We appreciate

310
00:17:20,400 --> 00:17:21,620
Your Majesty's kindness.

311
00:17:21,880 --> 00:17:24,496
However, Beijian is bitterly
cold throughout the year

312
00:17:24,520 --> 00:17:26,216
and has always prized the snow lotus.

313
00:17:26,240 --> 00:17:28,216
This Xiyan flower is rarely seen there.

314
00:17:28,240 --> 00:17:29,820
I see.

315
00:17:30,360 --> 00:17:33,416
I wondered why so many
treasures presented by your kingdom

316
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:35,576
were intricately carved
with snow-lotus patterns.

317
00:17:35,600 --> 00:17:37,096
Now I understand.

318
00:17:37,120 --> 00:17:38,856
By order of our sovereign,

319
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:39,856
I have come to pay homage.

320
00:17:39,880 --> 00:17:41,976
We wish only for Beijian and Great Ning

321
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:43,256
to remain bound in lasting friendship.

322
00:17:43,280 --> 00:17:45,336
Great Ning likewise wishes

323
00:17:45,360 --> 00:17:46,816
to maintain friendly
relations with Beijian,

324
00:17:46,840 --> 00:17:48,380
securing peace along the frontier.

325
00:18:22,120 --> 00:18:23,580
Zhili.

326
00:18:24,080 --> 00:18:25,220
Zhili.

327
00:18:30,480 --> 00:18:31,940
My lord.

328
00:18:34,520 --> 00:18:35,416
My lord.

329
00:18:35,440 --> 00:18:36,456
You are injured.

330
00:18:36,480 --> 00:18:37,620
I have medicine.

331
00:18:38,080 --> 00:18:39,220
Are you all right?

332
00:18:43,480 --> 00:18:44,456
Yin Qing.

333
00:18:44,480 --> 00:18:45,900
Are you all right?

334
00:18:46,760 --> 00:18:47,900
I am fine.

335
00:18:49,440 --> 00:18:51,180
It is only a superficial wound.

336
00:18:58,040 --> 00:18:59,220
This carriage

337
00:18:59,480 --> 00:19:00,936
was never heading to
Spring Night Courtyard.

338
00:19:00,960 --> 00:19:03,176
Where can we find the
real Flower Banquet now?

339
00:19:03,200 --> 00:19:06,180
I know where the Flower Banquet really is.

340
00:19:19,200 --> 00:19:20,700
Leader.

341
00:19:35,240 --> 00:19:36,380
Stop!

342
00:19:43,040 --> 00:19:44,300
Do not move!

343
00:19:45,560 --> 00:19:46,700
Do not move!

344
00:19:50,840 --> 00:19:52,660
Do not move. Kneel!

345
00:19:53,200 --> 00:19:54,540
You animals!

346
00:19:58,440 --> 00:20:00,456
Official Meng, little brother,

347
00:20:00,480 --> 00:20:02,416
what is the meaning of this spectacle?

348
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:04,256
Are you here to destroy my business?

349
00:20:04,280 --> 00:20:06,936
Hao Wenming, relying on
the Tiger Roar Gang's power,

350
00:20:06,960 --> 00:20:08,136
used gambling as a cover

351
00:20:08,160 --> 00:20:09,056
to traffic women.

352
00:20:09,080 --> 00:20:10,456
You have now been caught red-handed.

353
00:20:10,480 --> 00:20:11,736
Official Meng,

354
00:20:11,760 --> 00:20:13,816
do not falsely accuse an innocent man.

355
00:20:13,840 --> 00:20:15,536
We are merely holding a banquet

356
00:20:15,560 --> 00:20:16,696
and playing a few games.

357
00:20:16,720 --> 00:20:17,976
Games?

358
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:19,376
Allowing women to be humiliated at will

359
00:20:19,400 --> 00:20:21,660
is what you call a game?

360
00:20:22,360 --> 00:20:23,820
Official Meng.

361
00:20:24,240 --> 00:20:26,576
Why get so angry?

362
00:20:26,600 --> 00:20:27,576
We are all on the same side.

363
00:20:27,600 --> 00:20:28,696
They are all our own people.

364
00:20:28,720 --> 00:20:29,736
Who is on your side?

365
00:20:29,760 --> 00:20:31,296
My lord is innocent and upright.

366
00:20:31,320 --> 00:20:33,060
How dare you slander her?

367
00:20:37,320 --> 00:20:38,540
Little brother,

368
00:20:39,440 --> 00:20:42,136
why turn on me now?

369
00:20:42,160 --> 00:20:43,536
A few days ago, I gave you a necklace

370
00:20:43,560 --> 00:20:45,296
-worth a fortune...
-Enough nonsense.

371
00:20:45,320 --> 00:20:46,216
Arrest them.

372
00:20:46,240 --> 00:20:48,380
-Wait...
-Outrageous!

373
00:20:55,040 --> 00:20:56,616
Under the Son of Heaven's very feet,

374
00:20:56,640 --> 00:20:58,736
such depravity is being committed.

375
00:20:58,760 --> 00:21:00,216
The Court arrived just in time.

376
00:21:00,240 --> 00:21:01,296
Vice Minister Zheng.

377
00:21:01,320 --> 00:21:02,456
These animals...

378
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:03,816
I received a report from the people

379
00:21:03,840 --> 00:21:05,616
accusing Meng Tinghui of taking bribes

380
00:21:05,640 --> 00:21:06,856
and engaging in group debauchery.

381
00:21:06,880 --> 00:21:08,380
I have come to investigate thoroughly.

382
00:21:08,800 --> 00:21:09,940
An obscene gathering?

383
00:21:10,200 --> 00:21:11,696
My lord came here to investigate a case.

384
00:21:11,720 --> 00:21:12,616
There must be a misunderstanding.

385
00:21:12,640 --> 00:21:15,300
I have already sent men to
search Bofeng House for illicit property.

386
00:21:15,560 --> 00:21:16,816
Whether this is a misunderstanding

387
00:21:16,840 --> 00:21:18,220
will soon be clear.

388
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:24,420
Hurry...

389
00:21:25,040 --> 00:21:26,496
Officers,

390
00:21:26,520 --> 00:21:27,656
what is happening?

391
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:29,056
-Search the place.
-Yes.

392
00:21:29,080 --> 00:21:30,376
You...

393
00:21:30,400 --> 00:21:32,056
What are you doing?

394
00:21:32,080 --> 00:21:34,740
Vice Minister Zheng, please judge fairly.

395
00:21:35,120 --> 00:21:36,576
Meng Tinghui abused her authority

396
00:21:36,600 --> 00:21:38,816
and forced me to sign an agreement

397
00:21:38,840 --> 00:21:41,696
giving her thirty percent of
my gambling house's profits.

398
00:21:41,720 --> 00:21:42,896
She threatened

399
00:21:42,920 --> 00:21:44,500
that if I refused,

400
00:21:45,640 --> 00:21:48,096
she would make trouble
for my gambling house.

401
00:21:48,120 --> 00:21:49,740
Hao Wenming,

402
00:21:50,440 --> 00:21:53,020
you are quite skilled at
making false accusations.

403
00:21:53,760 --> 00:21:54,656
Vice Minister Zheng,

404
00:21:54,680 --> 00:21:55,816
please look.

405
00:21:55,840 --> 00:21:57,816
It is written clearly here

406
00:21:57,840 --> 00:22:00,300
with Meng Tinghui's own signature.

407
00:22:16,440 --> 00:22:17,536
This...

408
00:22:17,560 --> 00:22:18,656
Proprietor Hao,

409
00:22:18,680 --> 00:22:20,176
where is the handwriting you mentioned?

410
00:22:20,200 --> 00:22:21,616
You dare

411
00:22:21,640 --> 00:22:23,336
slander an imperial
official without evidence?

412
00:22:23,360 --> 00:22:24,376
My lord.

413
00:22:24,400 --> 00:22:25,336
Proprietor Hao,

414
00:22:25,360 --> 00:22:26,856
perhaps you are still drunk?

415
00:22:26,880 --> 00:22:28,736
Are you playing tricks with me?

416
00:22:28,760 --> 00:22:29,896
Uncle Hao.

417
00:22:29,920 --> 00:22:31,576
There is also a chest of gold,
silver, and jewels.

418
00:22:31,600 --> 00:22:33,896
Yes, a chest of jewels.

419
00:22:33,920 --> 00:22:36,740
She extorted it from me as a deposit.

420
00:22:41,560 --> 00:22:43,576
My lord, these are the illicit goods

421
00:22:43,600 --> 00:22:44,740
we found at Bofeng House.

422
00:22:46,400 --> 00:22:48,616
This is the evidence.

423
00:22:48,640 --> 00:22:50,376
Vice Minister Zheng,

424
00:22:50,400 --> 00:22:52,296
please uphold justice for us.

425
00:22:52,320 --> 00:22:54,336
This is my personal property,

426
00:22:54,360 --> 00:22:55,496
not illicit goods.

427
00:22:55,520 --> 00:22:56,736
Nonsense.

428
00:22:56,760 --> 00:22:59,056
You are merely a newly
appointed sixth-rank official.

429
00:22:59,080 --> 00:23:00,216
Where did you get so much wealth?

430
00:23:00,240 --> 00:23:02,776
It was naturally a gift from my
lord's dear friend, Shopkeeper Yan,

431
00:23:02,800 --> 00:23:04,016
to thank my lord

432
00:23:04,040 --> 00:23:05,816
for devising strategies
to run Bofeng House.

433
00:23:05,840 --> 00:23:07,016
Bullshit!

434
00:23:07,040 --> 00:23:08,656
That is all my silver.

435
00:23:08,680 --> 00:23:10,216
I am telling you, these chests

436
00:23:10,240 --> 00:23:12,496
were specially made for
Xingrong Gambling House

437
00:23:12,520 --> 00:23:14,576
and bear our seal.

438
00:23:14,600 --> 00:23:15,976
Do you dare let the soldiers inspect them?

439
00:23:16,000 --> 00:23:17,700
This is my lord's property.

440
00:23:18,120 --> 00:23:19,056
Why should you search it?

441
00:23:19,080 --> 00:23:20,376
This is outright harassment.

442
00:23:20,400 --> 00:23:21,456
You cannot determine ownership

443
00:23:21,480 --> 00:23:22,740
from a seal alone.

444
00:23:23,480 --> 00:23:25,696
That is far too careless.
I refuse to accept it.

445
00:23:25,720 --> 00:23:27,616
Stop twisting the facts!

446
00:23:27,640 --> 00:23:28,976
If the bottom of the chest

447
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:31,056
bears Xingrong Gambling House's seal,

448
00:23:31,080 --> 00:23:32,216
then it is my silver.

449
00:23:32,240 --> 00:23:33,616
If it bears Bofeng House's seal,

450
00:23:33,640 --> 00:23:35,140
then it is yours.

451
00:23:35,400 --> 00:23:36,900
You are feeling guilty.

452
00:23:37,840 --> 00:23:39,420
Move aside.

453
00:23:40,200 --> 00:23:41,340
Hands off.

454
00:23:46,800 --> 00:23:47,776
My lord.

455
00:23:47,800 --> 00:23:49,060
Please look.

456
00:23:55,160 --> 00:23:56,460
This...

457
00:23:59,840 --> 00:24:01,180
Proprietor Hao,

458
00:24:02,080 --> 00:24:03,336
you just said yourself

459
00:24:03,360 --> 00:24:05,336
that the silver belongs to whoever's seal

460
00:24:05,360 --> 00:24:07,060
appears on the bottom of the chest.

461
00:24:07,760 --> 00:24:09,656
Vice Minister Zheng and all the officers

462
00:24:09,680 --> 00:24:11,216
saw it with your own eyes.

463
00:24:11,240 --> 00:24:13,416
The bottom bears Bofeng House's seal.

464
00:24:13,440 --> 00:24:15,940
Therefore, the silver belongs to my lord.

465
00:24:20,680 --> 00:24:21,576
Hao Wenming,

466
00:24:21,600 --> 00:24:24,096
from the moment you
handed me the agreement,

467
00:24:24,120 --> 00:24:25,820
you had already lost.

468
00:24:26,640 --> 00:24:28,616
I played this entire scene with you.

469
00:24:28,640 --> 00:24:29,780
Are you satisfied?

470
00:24:30,760 --> 00:24:32,656
Meng... Meng Tinghui,

471
00:24:32,680 --> 00:24:34,616
you...

472
00:24:34,640 --> 00:24:37,696
Vice Minister Zheng,
please investigate carefully.

473
00:24:37,720 --> 00:24:39,416
She must have tampered with it.

474
00:24:39,440 --> 00:24:41,740
You must redress our grievance.

475
00:24:43,080 --> 00:24:43,976
Meng Tinghui,

476
00:24:44,000 --> 00:24:45,376
you have always acted recklessly.

477
00:24:45,400 --> 00:24:46,936
A few words from your people

478
00:24:46,960 --> 00:24:48,380
cannot clear your suspicion.

479
00:24:48,800 --> 00:24:50,096
Come with me to the Court.

480
00:24:50,120 --> 00:24:51,536
If you are innocent,

481
00:24:51,560 --> 00:24:52,976
I will see justice done.

482
00:24:53,000 --> 00:24:55,900
The Court cannot interfere
with a Bureau investigation.

483
00:24:56,880 --> 00:24:59,056
If Vice Minister Zheng
wishes to question anyone,

484
00:24:59,080 --> 00:25:00,296
wait until we take them

485
00:25:00,320 --> 00:25:01,296
back to the Bureau.

486
00:25:01,320 --> 00:25:02,980
I am acting according to the law.

487
00:25:03,520 --> 00:25:05,420
I will not allow you to obstruct me.

488
00:25:06,480 --> 00:25:09,020
That man wears a red jade thumb ring

489
00:25:09,320 --> 00:25:11,100
engraved with a caged bird.

490
00:25:18,640 --> 00:25:20,976
You are the one who harmed A-Yue.

491
00:25:21,000 --> 00:25:22,936
You colluded with Hao Wenming

492
00:25:22,960 --> 00:25:24,736
and all the gamblers

493
00:25:24,760 --> 00:25:25,656
at the Flower Banquet.

494
00:25:25,680 --> 00:25:28,736
You did not come here to investigate today.

495
00:25:28,760 --> 00:25:30,420
You came for me.

496
00:25:32,000 --> 00:25:33,376
Meng Tinghui,

497
00:25:33,400 --> 00:25:34,656
stop speaking nonsense.

498
00:25:34,680 --> 00:25:36,696
A-Yue's testimony is at the Bureau.

499
00:25:36,720 --> 00:25:38,060
If you deny it,

500
00:25:38,440 --> 00:25:40,060
you can confront her here and now.

501
00:25:43,040 --> 00:25:45,180
You are merely a sixth-rank official.

502
00:25:45,560 --> 00:25:46,940
What can you possibly do to me?

503
00:25:47,200 --> 00:25:49,216
Open your eyes and look carefully.

504
00:25:49,240 --> 00:25:51,056
This is the staff bestowed by His Majesty.

505
00:25:51,080 --> 00:25:53,216
If only one of us

506
00:25:53,240 --> 00:25:54,660
can leave this gambling house alive,

507
00:25:55,400 --> 00:25:56,896
it will certainly be me.

508
00:25:56,920 --> 00:25:58,096
Divine Guard, hear my command.

509
00:25:58,120 --> 00:25:59,816
Anyone who takes another step

510
00:25:59,840 --> 00:26:01,860
is to be executed on the spot.

511
00:26:05,640 --> 00:26:06,780
His Majesty has arrived.

512
00:26:18,440 --> 00:26:20,696
Remove the masks

513
00:26:20,720 --> 00:26:22,056
from these beasts.

514
00:26:22,080 --> 00:26:23,260
Yes.

515
00:26:26,120 --> 00:26:28,216
Is that not Academician
Liu of the Hanlin Academy?

516
00:26:28,240 --> 00:26:29,936
You certainly remain
vigorous despite your age.

517
00:26:29,960 --> 00:26:31,216
Assistant Shen,

518
00:26:31,240 --> 00:26:32,736
you... You have mistaken
me for someone else.

519
00:26:32,760 --> 00:26:35,180
Is that not Vice Minister Zhang of Revenue?

520
00:26:36,000 --> 00:26:36,896
These gentlemen here

521
00:26:36,920 --> 00:26:38,740
also look rather familiar.

522
00:26:39,000 --> 00:26:40,896
What a fine group of hypocritical

523
00:26:40,920 --> 00:26:42,536
parasites of the state.

524
00:26:42,560 --> 00:26:44,096
Since you are all so afraid

525
00:26:44,120 --> 00:26:45,496
to show your true faces,

526
00:26:45,520 --> 00:26:47,536
let them remain dressed like this

527
00:26:47,560 --> 00:26:49,816
and parade them from the
gambling house to the imperial prison.

528
00:26:49,840 --> 00:26:51,896
Let the people of the capital see

529
00:26:51,920 --> 00:26:53,216
what kind of beasts

530
00:26:53,240 --> 00:26:55,540
hide beneath these fine robes.

531
00:26:56,000 --> 00:26:57,136
Zheng and his accomplices

532
00:26:57,160 --> 00:26:58,696
are to be imprisoned immediately

533
00:26:58,720 --> 00:27:00,300
to await judgment.

534
00:27:00,920 --> 00:27:02,376
-Move.
-Move.

535
00:27:02,400 --> 00:27:04,980
You two, stop standing there.

536
00:27:12,240 --> 00:27:13,136
Your Majesty,

537
00:27:13,160 --> 00:27:15,256
may these women

538
00:27:15,280 --> 00:27:16,456
be placed under the Bureau's care?

539
00:27:16,480 --> 00:27:18,980
I place this case entirely in your hands.

540
00:27:21,280 --> 00:27:22,460
Thank you, Your Majesty.

541
00:27:23,280 --> 00:27:24,420
Yin Qing.

542
00:27:25,800 --> 00:27:28,020
Get up. It is all right now.

543
00:27:34,960 --> 00:27:36,180
Thank you, Your Majesty.

544
00:27:45,440 --> 00:27:48,536
Official Meng's skill at
swapping one thing for another

545
00:27:48,560 --> 00:27:50,380
has certainly improved.

546
00:27:51,000 --> 00:27:51,896
Well?

547
00:27:51,920 --> 00:27:53,740
Will you confess honestly on your own,

548
00:27:54,040 --> 00:27:55,180
or shall I wait...

549
00:28:10,720 --> 00:28:11,980
Stop pretending.

550
00:28:12,280 --> 00:28:14,376
Only the two of us are here.

551
00:28:14,400 --> 00:28:16,056
If you continue pretending,

552
00:28:16,080 --> 00:28:18,220
you may truly sleep until tomorrow morning.

553
00:28:30,000 --> 00:28:31,460
Your Majesty,

554
00:28:31,680 --> 00:28:34,180
I deserve ten thousand deaths.

555
00:28:38,320 --> 00:28:40,896
My first fault was failing to
report to Your Majesty beforehand.

556
00:28:40,920 --> 00:28:42,776
The situation was urgent,

557
00:28:42,800 --> 00:28:44,620
and I did not wish to miss the opportunity.

558
00:28:44,960 --> 00:28:45,856
My second fault

559
00:28:45,880 --> 00:28:49,060
was accepting Hao Wenming's wealth.

560
00:28:49,320 --> 00:28:50,896
But I did not do so out of greed.

561
00:28:50,920 --> 00:28:52,536
It was only to gain his trust.

562
00:28:52,560 --> 00:28:53,780
Furthermore,

563
00:28:54,080 --> 00:28:56,100
I did not truly sign the agreement.

564
00:29:01,720 --> 00:29:03,536
Your Majesty, that is all.

565
00:29:03,560 --> 00:29:05,380
In that case,

566
00:29:05,560 --> 00:29:07,536
not only are you blameless,

567
00:29:07,560 --> 00:29:09,500
but you anticipated every possibility.

568
00:29:09,800 --> 00:29:12,216
You even calculated precisely
when to send Zhili for reinforcements,

569
00:29:12,240 --> 00:29:14,056
without the slightest error,

570
00:29:14,080 --> 00:29:17,140
allowing me the honor of witnessing

571
00:29:18,960 --> 00:29:21,656
the deep sisterly bond between
Official Meng and Shopkeeper Yan,

572
00:29:21,680 --> 00:29:24,216
as you boldly claimed black was white

573
00:29:24,240 --> 00:29:25,496
and the greedy were incorruptible.

574
00:29:25,520 --> 00:29:26,896
I never expected Official Meng

575
00:29:26,920 --> 00:29:30,060
to possess the bearing of
such a treacherous minister.

576
00:29:30,640 --> 00:29:32,496
So Your Majesty knew all along.

577
00:29:32,520 --> 00:29:34,300
Rise and speak.

578
00:29:40,600 --> 00:29:41,576
I want to know:

579
00:29:41,600 --> 00:29:42,696
had I

580
00:29:42,720 --> 00:29:44,620
not arrived in time today,

581
00:29:46,480 --> 00:29:48,376
how would you have resolved matters?

582
00:29:48,400 --> 00:29:49,616
I had the Divine Guard.

583
00:29:49,640 --> 00:29:51,696
The Divine Guard now belongs to you?

584
00:29:51,720 --> 00:29:53,420
Naturally, they belong to Your Majesty.

585
00:29:55,080 --> 00:29:57,096
The Tiger Roar Gang's money
also belongs to Your Majesty

586
00:29:57,120 --> 00:29:59,176
and is not supervised
by the Left Chancellor.

587
00:29:59,200 --> 00:30:00,820
Your Majesty may use it freely.

588
00:30:02,520 --> 00:30:03,700
Very well.

589
00:30:04,000 --> 00:30:05,420
It seems Official Meng

590
00:30:05,720 --> 00:30:07,496
can now even earn

591
00:30:07,520 --> 00:30:08,980
private funds for me,

592
00:30:09,440 --> 00:30:11,216
using silver to silence me

593
00:30:11,240 --> 00:30:13,220
and leaving me unable to blame you.

594
00:30:21,160 --> 00:30:22,776
I humbly beg Your Majesty

595
00:30:22,800 --> 00:30:24,296
to forgive me this once.

596
00:30:24,320 --> 00:30:25,696
Those women

597
00:30:25,720 --> 00:30:27,936
wished to leave their hometowns
through their own efforts.

598
00:30:27,960 --> 00:30:29,816
They were educated and principled,

599
00:30:29,840 --> 00:30:31,540
seeking only to serve the realm.

600
00:30:32,720 --> 00:30:34,100
Seeing them...

601
00:30:34,360 --> 00:30:35,900
suffering such torment

602
00:30:36,160 --> 00:30:37,700
breaks my heart.

603
00:30:38,080 --> 00:30:40,540
I had to obtain justice for them.

604
00:30:42,600 --> 00:30:44,900
I humbly beg Your Majesty...

605
00:30:50,760 --> 00:30:53,376
I never said I would punish you.

606
00:30:53,400 --> 00:30:55,460
Yet you began pleading guilty on your own.

607
00:30:55,880 --> 00:30:57,540
Enough pretending. Get up.

608
00:31:02,120 --> 00:31:03,260
Meng Tinghui.

609
00:31:14,360 --> 00:31:17,420
You have a fever, yet
you still force yourself.

610
00:32:19,960 --> 00:32:21,336
You are selfish and self-serving,

611
00:32:21,360 --> 00:32:22,696
and every word from your mouth is a lie.

612
00:32:22,720 --> 00:32:24,416
Once exposed, you resort
to clever arguments.

613
00:32:24,440 --> 00:32:26,936
Pretending innocence and acting
pitiful come naturally to you.

614
00:32:26,960 --> 00:32:29,296
You are cunning, deceitful,
and duplicitous.

615
00:32:29,320 --> 00:32:31,256
How do I know you are not deceiving me?

616
00:32:31,280 --> 00:32:34,100
Young Master remembers me remarkably well.

617
00:32:37,520 --> 00:32:39,656
What skill is there

618
00:32:39,680 --> 00:32:41,300
in bullying a helpless woman?

619
00:32:41,560 --> 00:32:42,696
Those who dare deceive me

620
00:32:42,720 --> 00:32:44,496
have only death awaiting them.

621
00:32:44,520 --> 00:32:45,656
You accursed jinx.

622
00:32:45,680 --> 00:32:47,060
Do not come back, shameless woman.

623
00:32:53,480 --> 00:32:55,576
This time,

624
00:32:55,600 --> 00:32:57,340
we are truly even.

625
00:33:17,440 --> 00:33:19,300
So you also have

626
00:33:19,600 --> 00:33:21,020
such an obedient side.

627
00:33:30,400 --> 00:33:32,260
My lord, the medicine is ready.

628
00:33:34,200 --> 00:33:35,340
Your Majesty.

629
00:33:35,800 --> 00:33:37,416
It is so late. You are still here?

630
00:33:37,440 --> 00:33:39,256
Why are you here so late?

631
00:33:39,280 --> 00:33:41,376
-Without even knocking.
-Your Majesty.

632
00:33:41,400 --> 00:33:43,496
My lord was injured today

633
00:33:43,520 --> 00:33:45,936
and was also frightened
after being taken hostage.

634
00:33:45,960 --> 00:33:47,776
So I prepared a bowl of
medicinal decoction for her.

635
00:33:47,800 --> 00:33:50,016
Let her drink it when she wakes tomorrow.

636
00:33:50,040 --> 00:33:50,936
You may leave.

637
00:33:50,960 --> 00:33:52,100
But...

638
00:33:54,320 --> 00:33:55,500
Yes.

639
00:33:55,880 --> 00:33:57,060
Wait.

640
00:33:57,440 --> 00:33:59,780
I saw that you were also injured today.

641
00:34:00,520 --> 00:34:01,660
You have worked hard.

642
00:34:02,040 --> 00:34:03,420
Rest early.

643
00:34:04,640 --> 00:34:06,700
So Your Majesty was concerned about me.

644
00:34:07,280 --> 00:34:08,620
Thank you, Your Majesty.

645
00:34:23,720 --> 00:34:26,016
Meng Tinghui, Director of the
Bureau of Intelligence,

646
00:34:26,040 --> 00:34:28,576
uncovered the Tiger Roar Gang's
gambling operation,

647
00:34:28,600 --> 00:34:30,616
rescued numerous female scholars,

648
00:34:30,640 --> 00:34:32,616
and eliminated corrupt
officials from the court.

649
00:34:32,640 --> 00:34:33,616
Her service is outstanding.

650
00:34:33,640 --> 00:34:36,536
She is hereby promoted from
Secondary Sixth Rank to Secondary Fifth Rank

651
00:34:36,560 --> 00:34:38,336
as a reward.

652
00:34:38,360 --> 00:34:39,496
Furthermore,

653
00:34:39,520 --> 00:34:41,816
all members of the Bureau of
Intelligence are also to be rewarded

654
00:34:41,840 --> 00:34:43,180
in recognition of their merit.

655
00:34:45,800 --> 00:34:47,500
Thank you for Your Majesty's great grace.

656
00:34:54,720 --> 00:34:55,860
Your Majesty,

657
00:34:56,640 --> 00:34:58,416
countless families have been torn apart,

658
00:34:58,440 --> 00:34:59,656
and countless homes destroyed,

659
00:34:59,680 --> 00:35:01,776
all because of gambling.

660
00:35:01,800 --> 00:35:04,576
Xingrong Gambling House was
not only involved in crime,

661
00:35:04,600 --> 00:35:06,136
but also abducted and
trafficked innocent women,

662
00:35:06,160 --> 00:35:07,816
while winning over court officials.

663
00:35:07,840 --> 00:35:08,776
It harmed the state and the people

664
00:35:08,800 --> 00:35:10,540
and was truly a grave national threat.

665
00:35:10,800 --> 00:35:13,100
I ask Your Majesty to protect
all women under heaven

666
00:35:13,640 --> 00:35:16,296
and prevent such tragedies
from happening again.

667
00:35:16,320 --> 00:35:18,060
That is precisely my intention.

668
00:35:18,520 --> 00:35:19,656
Chief Steward You.

669
00:35:19,680 --> 00:35:20,696
Proclaim the decree.

670
00:35:20,720 --> 00:35:22,536
From this day onward,

671
00:35:22,560 --> 00:35:24,016
anyone who abducts or traffics people,

672
00:35:24,040 --> 00:35:26,816
once convicted, whether
principal or accomplice,

673
00:35:26,840 --> 00:35:28,176
shall be executed immediately.

674
00:35:28,200 --> 00:35:29,776
Their property shall be confiscated,

675
00:35:29,800 --> 00:35:32,056
and their families exiled
three thousand li.

676
00:35:32,080 --> 00:35:34,456
Every prefecture must
conduct strict inspections

677
00:35:34,480 --> 00:35:35,936
to prevent abduction and fraud.

678
00:35:35,960 --> 00:35:37,336
Any negligence

679
00:35:37,360 --> 00:35:38,696
will be severely punished.

680
00:35:38,720 --> 00:35:40,096
Furthermore, throughout Great Ning,

681
00:35:40,120 --> 00:35:42,296
all gambling is prohibited.

682
00:35:42,320 --> 00:35:44,256
Anyone who operates a gambling house:

683
00:35:44,280 --> 00:35:47,216
the principal offender shall be beheaded,
and accomplices flogged one hundred strokes

684
00:35:47,240 --> 00:35:48,856
and exiled one thousand li.

685
00:35:48,880 --> 00:35:50,456
Gamblers shall be flogged
eight hundred strokes

686
00:35:50,480 --> 00:35:52,136
and fined one hundred taels.

687
00:35:52,160 --> 00:35:54,296
Every prefecture must investigate
and enforce this strictly.

688
00:35:54,320 --> 00:35:56,816
Anyone who shields offenders
will receive the same punishment.

689
00:35:56,840 --> 00:35:59,456
Thank you, Official Meng,
for saving us from misery.

690
00:35:59,480 --> 00:36:00,856
Thank you, Assistant Shen.

691
00:36:00,880 --> 00:36:02,776
Thank you, my lords.

692
00:36:02,800 --> 00:36:04,736
Scholars, there is no need to thank us.

693
00:36:04,760 --> 00:36:06,496
We have reported the matter to the court

694
00:36:06,520 --> 00:36:08,016
and requested compensation for you.

695
00:36:08,040 --> 00:36:09,456
Those who wish to return home

696
00:36:09,480 --> 00:36:11,056
will be given sufficient travel expenses.

697
00:36:11,080 --> 00:36:12,576
Those who wish to remain in the capital

698
00:36:12,600 --> 00:36:14,016
will be properly settled.

699
00:36:14,040 --> 00:36:15,656
Anyone who wishes to take
the imperial examination

700
00:36:15,680 --> 00:36:17,896
will receive the Bureau's
full recommendation.

701
00:36:17,920 --> 00:36:20,540
The Bureau of Intelligence
will be your steadfast support.

702
00:36:21,840 --> 00:36:22,736
Official Meng,

703
00:36:22,760 --> 00:36:24,016
although I have suffered greatly,

704
00:36:24,040 --> 00:36:25,536
I still wish to take the
imperial examination,

705
00:36:25,560 --> 00:36:27,176
earn official honors like you,

706
00:36:27,200 --> 00:36:28,460
and become a good official.

707
00:36:28,760 --> 00:36:30,576
My hometown lies far on the frontier.

708
00:36:30,600 --> 00:36:32,496
Most women there are
confined to their homes.

709
00:36:32,520 --> 00:36:34,060
I wish to return and teach,

710
00:36:34,320 --> 00:36:35,536
so they may know

711
00:36:35,560 --> 00:36:38,296
that women can also carve
out a world for themselves.

712
00:36:38,320 --> 00:36:40,980
Women indeed face greater
hardship than men in this world.

713
00:36:41,240 --> 00:36:42,696
But as long as there
is light in your hearts,

714
00:36:42,720 --> 00:36:44,420
the clouds will part to reveal the sun.

715
00:36:44,680 --> 00:36:46,580
Seeing that you possess such resolve,

716
00:36:46,880 --> 00:36:48,296
we can rest easy.

717
00:36:48,320 --> 00:36:49,660
Education

718
00:36:50,560 --> 00:36:52,336
will always give people hope.

719
00:36:52,360 --> 00:36:53,696
Thank you, Official Meng.

720
00:36:53,720 --> 00:36:55,096
Thank you, Assistant Shen.

721
00:36:55,120 --> 00:36:56,980
You are all role models for women.

722
00:37:35,680 --> 00:37:37,576
With a blade hanging at your neck,

723
00:37:37,600 --> 00:37:40,180
you still have the leisure
for such refinement?

724
00:37:40,440 --> 00:37:42,176
Why are you in such a hurry, brother?

725
00:37:42,200 --> 00:37:44,176
Are you afraid the flames
will burn too fiercely

726
00:37:44,200 --> 00:37:46,500
and scorch that official robe of yours?

727
00:37:47,400 --> 00:37:49,820
Hao Wenming is on the
Bureau's torture rack.

728
00:37:50,320 --> 00:37:52,936
How long do you think he
can hold out before talking?

729
00:37:52,960 --> 00:37:55,256
If he dares reveal another word,

730
00:37:55,280 --> 00:37:56,856
I will have his entire
family buried with him.

731
00:37:56,880 --> 00:37:57,816
Restrain yourself,

732
00:37:57,840 --> 00:38:00,300
next time it will be the
Divine Guard who comes.

733
00:38:01,040 --> 00:38:03,940
Such imposing official authority, brother.

734
00:38:05,240 --> 00:38:07,580
When you used my
gambling house's honey trap

735
00:38:07,880 --> 00:38:10,340
to pave the way for your promotion,

736
00:38:11,680 --> 00:38:13,940
where was this mercy of yours?

737
00:38:14,120 --> 00:38:15,900
Now that the matter has been exposed,

738
00:38:16,240 --> 00:38:18,140
you wish to burn the
bridge after crossing it?

739
00:38:18,960 --> 00:38:21,296
The gambling ban costs me
ten thousand taels every day.

740
00:38:21,320 --> 00:38:23,256
I must settle this debt.

741
00:38:23,280 --> 00:38:25,056
You are utterly insane.

742
00:38:25,080 --> 00:38:27,536
Do you wish to repeat

743
00:38:27,560 --> 00:38:28,860
sacrificing your kin for justice?

744
00:38:30,840 --> 00:38:32,136
Over the years,

745
00:38:32,160 --> 00:38:33,896
every illicit payment you accepted

746
00:38:33,920 --> 00:38:35,496
is recorded here.

747
00:38:35,520 --> 00:38:38,220
The Bureau of Intelligence
will certainly be interested.

748
00:38:38,680 --> 00:38:39,576
Do not worry.

749
00:38:39,600 --> 00:38:42,860
I value family even more than you do.

750
00:38:43,600 --> 00:38:46,220
After all, you are my only blood relative.

751
00:38:47,440 --> 00:38:48,820
What happened back then

752
00:38:50,560 --> 00:38:52,216
was my fault.

753
00:38:52,240 --> 00:38:53,900
But at the time,

754
00:38:54,280 --> 00:38:56,100
I had no other choice.

755
00:38:57,720 --> 00:38:59,860
Though we were born of different mothers,

756
00:39:00,920 --> 00:39:03,700
that day, when you were pinned
in the mud and begged for help,

757
00:39:04,880 --> 00:39:06,176
the way you called me "brother"

758
00:39:06,200 --> 00:39:08,180
has stayed with me for twenty years.

759
00:39:11,200 --> 00:39:13,696
Do you think the Tiger Roar Gang
reached this point

760
00:39:13,720 --> 00:39:15,816
through luck alone?

761
00:39:15,840 --> 00:39:17,260
Then now,

762
00:39:18,320 --> 00:39:21,536
can you turn the gambling ban
into a worthless piece of paper?

763
00:39:21,560 --> 00:39:23,700
I will do everything possible
to maneuver at court.

764
00:39:25,760 --> 00:39:27,336
But you must restrain yourself.

765
00:39:27,360 --> 00:39:31,140
For now, do not make another
move against Meng Tinghui.
